[{"title":"游西湖与徐都尉分得香字二首 其一","author":"李质","text":"轻云阁里弄晴光，湖水湖山引兴长。\n荇带谩萦春浪细，客衣初试越罗香。\n荷杯擎露鲛人泣，翠葆掀风海树凉。\n好傍绿阴维画舫，高歌白纻送清觞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33597,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游西湖与徐都尉分得香字二首 其二","author":"李质","text":"湖边把臂送春光，可恨东君去路长。\n赠玉岂无湘女佩，惜花那得返魂香。\n脍分金鲫银丝脆，酒吸椰杯瑞露凉。\n座上总能文字饮，绝胜红袖佐飞觞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33598,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题读书岩","author":"李质","text":"独秀山椒石室幽，弦歌太守日来游。\n不图文史三冬足，常有烟霞五色浮。\n道路只今徇木铎，云礽又复绍箕裘。\n观山未了仍观画，冰雪相看两鬓秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33599,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题董相生青山白云斋","author":"李质","text":"堂前叆叇护参差，世外红尘绝是非。\n远树好烟长对坐，落花流水暗通池。\n岁寒桂岭松凋后，秋晚漓江石出时。\n岂为康山成野癖，故留青白豁襟期。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33600,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"洪武三年朝京师转授山东等处行中书省参知政事有感而作","author":"何真","text":"鼎沸图存仅十年，平生忠义在安边。\n英雄不学万人敌，方寸长悬尺五天。\n宣布曾分南国政，贤劳敢咏北山篇。\n真心独有松堪比，臣节惟应老更坚。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33601,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"洪武四年蒙宣回京钦差回广东收集军士道经梅关谒张公九龄诗","author":"何真","text":"提兵昔过梅关北，奉命今还五岭东。\n古庙尚留朱履迹，旧题羞见碧纱笼。\n一天云气千山雨，万壑松声十里风。\n谒罢相祠重回首，蓬莱宫阙五云中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33602,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"征蛮洞作","author":"何真","text":"蛮烟漠漠障荆隈，日到天中尚未开。\n中土尽皆沾露雨，荒边何足动风雷。\n投鞭饮马黄河竭，指手挥戈华岳摧。\n不识洗天风雨起，片霞犹得拟中台。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33603,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过龙潭峡","author":"何真","text":"水落鼋鼍隐钓台，峡山风动野云开。\n寒潭昨夜龙归晚，带得山前骤雨来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33604,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"自题淡轩","author":"张守忠","text":"世乱缤纷我独遭，归来行径长蓬蒿。\n探囊已觉黄金尽，绕舍惟看绿树高。\n消闷每沽村店酒，禦寒空借故人袍。\n掩门独坐凭谁问，白发萧萧两鬓毛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33605,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"香山乾明寺 德庆","author":"李穆","text":"香山秀耸千寻碧，绝顶去天不盈尺。\n达摩只履昔西归，蹑石犹疑留一迹。\n使君览胜游招提，胡不邀我同攀跻。\n凭高傲睨九州小，便欲乘此淩天梯。\n两人相对掀长髯，指顾万里舒双尖。\n昔年云气漫山麓，至今郡志传龙潜。\n朅来沧海已清浅，此地依然是重巘。\n摩挲为觅旧镌题，零落残碑卧苍藓。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33606,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"陆大夫祠","author":"李穆","text":"云根千尺倚苍旻，苔藓斓斑锦裹新。\n使节南来能掉舌，赵佗百拜远称臣。\n千年伟绩传编简，一片残碑卧棘榛。\n过客临风遥致敬，匆匆不及荐秋蘋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33607,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"佛迹石","author":"李穆","text":"达摩西归古昔闻，漫疑一足蹑云根。\n穷探绝顶搜遗迹，净拂苍苔见巨痕。\n野寺山藏岚气合，长松风度梵音喧。\n康州胜概应多览，归向金身得细论。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33608,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"樵云五景诗 其一 悠然佳趣","author":"李穆","text":"迹远尘嚣地更偏，心游物外兴悠然。\n夕阳欲下鸟飞尽，喜有南山在目前。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33609,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"樵云五景诗 其二 翠暖长春","author":"李穆","text":"乱山深处结茅亭，暖日烟霞锁翠屏。\n松下茯苓秋可斸，投簪从此老岩扃。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33610,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"樵云五景诗 其三 翠微清晓","author":"李穆","text":"轻岚作雾曙光微，翠湿高松露未晞。\n天畔倚栏人乍起，一声山鸟近檐飞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33611,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"樵云五景诗 其四 枕流琼响","author":"李穆","text":"桥下泠泠漱玉鸣，出山不似在山清。\n有人高枕云根卧，何必沧浪在濯缨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33612,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"樵云五景诗 其五 息肩馀暇","author":"李穆","text":"生涯随分乐樵苏，弛担归来日未晡。\n松下清风宜少憩，终南捷径苦崎岖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33613,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"舟次三洲夜月","author":"李穆","text":"晋康佳致属三洲，山有奇岩水有湫。\n怪石嵌空垂玉乳，长江影月走金虬。\n星河冷浸三更露，天水光涵一色秋。\n久客怀归心欲折，好乘清兴夜行舟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33614,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"复温兰岩寄韵","author":"李穆","text":"一年春景将过半，满目闲愁苦未开。\n北海孔融偏好客，长沙贾谊最多才。\n云移日影阶前转，风挟潮声枕畔来。\n独有可人招不得，酣歌倚树自徘徊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33615,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送刘兵马天章","author":"李穆","text":"锦水无波画鹢开，刘郎年少负多才。\n袖中诗卷逢人看，江上梅花照客回。\n百粤雄藩兼两道，六符深处映三台。\n乾坤浩浩春如许，自有黄金百尺台。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33616,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"初归寄郭希圣","author":"李穆","text":"十年书剑客侯门，万里归来荷圣恩。\n晓日一庭诗礼计，西风三径菊松存。\n倚筇锦石暮山紫，濯足罗旁秋水浑。\n相望片云成契阔，好怀那得与君论。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33617,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏何节妇","author":"萧至善","text":"夫命已从兵下殒，妾身宁向井中亡。\n何村千古青山地，应合更名节妇乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33618,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏何节妇","author":"邓仕均","text":"群凶贪色复贪金，岂料佳人用计深。\n下视井水清澈底，此时方见阿侬心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33619,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏赵烈女","author":"邓仕均","text":"苍忙就执忍偷生，欲死身无寸许兵。\n箭刃谁云能自决，只应扶助有神明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33620,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏何节妇","author":"冯德纯","text":"世变良人陷绿林，吞声便尔井中沉。\n誓将身共寒泉洁，不受兵尘半点侵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33621,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠新会陈季谦充贡北上","author":"元吉","text":"珠江烟岛泊兰桡，别绪逢春绾柳条。\n骐骥自能追紫电，凤鸾应是到青霄。\n罗浮卓锡泉何在，洙泗逢原路岂遥。\n谁向江门学云卧，问津元不待相招。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33622,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜坐吟","author":"元夕","text":"除夕既除春夕饶，焚香高拱度春宵。\n风出江声波发船，长歌顾影一凄然。\n歌已歇，转悲吟。\n空有曲，孰关心。\n心不同，曲徒工。\n馀此调，入江流。\n江流终相和，知音错向人间求。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33623,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"仙吕 寄生草 其一 闲评","author":"无名氏","text":"问什么虚名利，管什么闲是非。\n想著他击珊瑚列锦幛石崇势，则不如卸罗裾纳象简张良退，学取他枕清风铺明月陈抟睡。\n看了那吴山青似越山青，不如今朝醉了明朝醉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33624,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"仙吕 寄生草 其二 闲评","author":"无名氏","text":"争闲气、使见识，赤壁山正中周郎计，乌江岸枉费重瞳力，马嵬坡空洒明皇泪。\n前人勋业后人看，不如今朝醉了明朝醉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33625,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"正宫 塞鸿秋","author":"无名氏","text":"一对紫燕儿雕梁上肩相并，一对粉蝶儿花丛上偏相趁，一对鸳鸯儿水面上相交颈，一对虎猫儿绣凳上相偎定。\n觑了动人情，不由人心儿硬，冷清清偏俺合孤零。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33626,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"商调 梧叶儿 嘲谎人","author":"无名氏","text":"东村里鸡生凤，南庄上马变牛，六月里裹皮裘。\n瓦垄上宜栽树，阳沟里好驾舟。\n瓮来大肉馒头，俺家茄子大如斗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33627,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"商调 梧叶儿 嘲贪汉","author":"无名氏","text":"一粒米针穿著吃，一文钱剪截充，但开口昧神灵。\n看儿女如衔泥燕，爱钱财似竞血蝇。\n无明夜攒金银，都做充饥画饼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33628,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"正宫 其一 叨叨令","author":"无名氏","text":"黄尘万古长安路，折碑三尺邙山墓。\n西风一叶乌江渡，夕阳十里邯郸树。\n老了人也么哥，老了人也么哥，英雄尽是伤心处。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33629,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"正宫 其二 叨叨令","author":"无名氏","text":"只见青帘高挂垂杨树，朱帘暮卷西山雨。\n谁待向禁城狼虎丛中去，我则待侬家鹦鹉洲边住。\n倒大来快活也么哥，快活也么哥，抵多少梦回明月生南浦。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33630,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"中吕 其一 红绣鞋","author":"无名氏","text":"窗外雨声声不住，枕边泪点点长吁，雨声泪点急相逐。\n雨声儿添凄惨，泪点儿助长吁。\n枕边泪倒多如窗外雨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33631,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"中吕 朝天子 志感","author":"无名氏","text":"不读书有权，不识字有钱，不晓事倒有人誇荐。\n老天只恁忒心偏，贤和愚无分辨。\n折挫英雄，消磨良善，越聪明越运蹇。\n志高如鲁连，德高如闵蹇，依本分只落的人轻贱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33632,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"醉太平 无题","author":"无名氏","text":"利名场事冗。\n林泉下心冲。\n小柴门画戟古城东。\n隔风波数重。\n华山云不到阳台梦。\n溪水不接桃源洞。\n洛阳城不到武夷峰。\n老先生睡浓。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33633,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"醉中平 无题","author":"无名氏","text":"泪溅端溪砚。\n情写锦花笺。\n日暮帘栊生暖烟。\n睡煞梁间燕。\n人比青山更远。\n梨花庭院。\n月明闲却秋千。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33634,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"喜春来 闺情","author":"无名氏","text":"窄裁衫裉安排瘦。\n淡扫蛾眉准备愁。\n思君一度一登楼。\n凝望久。\n雁过楚天秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33635,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"朝天子 庐山","author":"无名氏","text":"早霞。\n晚霞。\n装点庐山画。\n仙翁何处炼丹砂。\n一缕白云下。\n客去斋馀。\n人来茶罢。\n叹浮生指落花。\n楚家。\n汉家。\n做了渔樵话。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33636,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"金字经 秋夜","author":"无名氏","text":"我来山中宿。\n夜深云满衣。\n月皎风清星斗稀。\n惊鸟无所依。\n乖秋意。\n卧将箫管吹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33637,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"庆东原 奇遇","author":"无名氏","text":"参旗动。\n斗柄挪。\n为多情揽下风流祸。\n眉攒翠蛾。\n裙拖绛罗。\n袜冷凌波。\n耽惊怕万千般。\n得受用些儿个。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33638,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"清江引 九日","author":"无名氏","text":"萧萧五株门外柳。\n屈指重阳又。\n霜清紫蟹肥。\n露冷黄花瘦。\n白衣不来琴当酒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33639,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"驻马听 无题","author":"无名氏","text":"月小潮平。\n红蓼滩头秋水冷。\n天空云净。\n夕阳江上乱峰青。\n一蓑全却子陵名。\n五湖救了鸱夷命。\n尘劳事不听。\n龙蛇一任相吞并。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33640,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"凭阑人 无题","author":"无名氏","text":"点破苍苔墙角萤。\n战退西风檐外铃。\n画楼风露清。\n玉阑桐叶零。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33641,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟常建题破山寺","author":"马臻","text":"古寺破山色，入门松竹阴。\n雨花传祖意，坐石契禅心。\n潭静白云上，月高清梵沈。\n几时辞一尉，寻社入东林。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33642,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽蒋步陶","author":"元亮","text":"昔日子过我，欢笑无与伦。\n今日我过子，气结不得伸。\n生死既异趣，人鬼亦殊因。\n谁能无怛化，宅心栖元神。\n功名尽黄土，富贵同飙尘。\n所以旷达流，行乐须及春。\n已往不可作，来者将代新。\n怜子更无嗣，兼少骨肉亲。\n遗稿渐零落，心血谁为珍。\n弱弟未成立，一棺徒逡巡。\n嗒焉丧厥偶，登堂念德邻。\n音容邈何许，对面如越秦。\n曷不忍须臾，竟尔反其真。\n倏忽遗世想，先我成古人。\n我来岁云暮，吁嗟骨已陈。\n前路正茫黑，况于忧患频。\n旦夕岂自保，日月驰两轮。\n毋为形所役，悠哉谢劳薪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33643,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书顾耕石侍讲","author":"元熙","text":"烟水空濛万象虚，西湖画景付樵渔。\n一从学士新诗出，纵有荆关画不如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33644,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书顾耕石侍讲","author":"元熙","text":"星使词曹节屡颁，三巴五岭驻征鞍。\n巫阳底事催归早，长吉箜?付广寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33645,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书顾耕石侍讲","author":"元熙","text":"长安结队走名场，触目珠玑夜有光。\n毕竟心传家学远，虎儿妙腕继元章。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33646,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书顾耕石侍讲","author":"元熙","text":"吴都狂客最驰名，夙抱清才杂艳情。\n读万卷书行万里，诗家例住锦官城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33647,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书顾耕石侍讲","author":"元熙","text":"鹍弦高唱大江东，词句堪称一代雄。\n从此弓衣传绣遍，好将佳话播吴中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33648,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书顾耕石侍讲","author":"元熙","text":"群纪交情托麝煤，一回展玩一颜开。\n凭他半幅鹅溪绢，抵得黄金百镒来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33649,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽从兄","author":"元善","text":"一病竟不起，何期遽哭君。\n风神难再挹，生死此长分。\n性戆怀偏直，情真意每殷。\n青冥安可返，怅望浦头云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33650,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其一 琴","author":"郭居敬","text":"高山影里希音远，流水声中古调长。\n可惜世无钟子期，焦桐空带爨烟香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33651,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其二 棋","author":"郭居敬","text":"柳荫深深日正长，不知谁向静中忙。\n几回落于晴窗午，吟梦惊回春草香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33652,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其三 书","author":"郭居敬","text":"退笔成堆可冢藏，半生辛苦学钟王。\n君看窗外寒池水，暖日浓薰气墨香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33653,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其四 笔","author":"郭居敬","text":"梯云来自广寒乡，拔后霜毫锐似铓。\n留与谪仙题品用，沉香亭北牡丹香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33654,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其五 画","author":"郭居敬","text":"流水无声空浩渺，远山有色甚微茫。\n毫端别有春风处，倚竹梅花带月香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33655,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其六 墨","author":"郭居敬","text":"十八公生万仞岗，灰心火月利文房。\n陶泓池畔玄云起，犹带徂徕风雪香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33656,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其七 砚","author":"郭居敬","text":"买得昆山玉一方，吟边磨琢岁华长。\n夜来宝匣忘收闭，一点飞红清墨香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33657,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其八 纸","author":"郭居敬","text":"赋就三都穷价直，楼修五凤擅文章。\n都缘白似梅花好，写出新吟字字香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33658,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其九 洗砚","author":"郭居敬","text":"石丈经旬卧笔床，紫云涤净玉生光。\n烟波流入长江去，薰透鱼龙国里香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33659,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其十 扇","author":"郭居敬","text":"一片齐纨白似霜，团团明月出东方。\n池亭宴坐轻摇处，引得荷风掠面香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33660,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其十一 剪刀","author":"郭居敬","text":"双股尖齐燕尾长，良工磨削白如霜。\n晓庭剪断梨花□，带得一些春露香。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33661,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其十二 渔舟","author":"郭居敬","text":"一棹翩翩活计长，五湖四海是家乡。\n朝来撑出柳阴去，冲落江花带雨香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33662,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其十三 笛","author":"郭居敬","text":"蕲竹新栽尺许长，月明三弄据胡床。\n一声风引云端去，吹落梅花只欠香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33663,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其十四 灯","author":"郭居敬","text":"院宇沉沉秋气凉，重帘低下护清光。\n夜深忽报书生喜，红绽釭花一蕊香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33664,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其十五 烛","author":"郭居敬","text":"红影摇摇白玉堂，寸心只愿照逃亡。\n翰林记得皈来晚，荣赐金莲一炬香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33665,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百香诗 其十六 镜","author":"郭居敬","text":"百炼千磨日色光，世间妍丑不韬藏。\n含章檐下东风里，曾照梅花五出香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":33666,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]